OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 62, 'died while saving     
OL,4,Agrandson's life'                       
OL,6,FA family have paid tribute to a        
OL,7,Fgrandmother who they say died while    
OL,8,Fsaving the life of her grandson,       
OL,9,Fdescribing her as a "hero".            
OL,11,FBarbara Barganska, 62, lost her life   
OL,12,Fwhen she was struck by an HGV while on 
OL,13,Ffoot at traffic lights in Stallard     
OL,14,FStreet in Trowbridge, Wiltshire at     
OL,15,F10:00 BST on 23 November.              
OL,17,FShe was with her two-year-old grandson 
OL,18,Fat the time of the crash it is believed
OL,19,Fthe reason he did not suffer any       
OL,20,Fserious injuries is because she pushed 
OL,21,Fhis buggy out of the way.              
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
