OL,3,GNEWSAWoman, 62, 'died while saving     
OL,4,Agrandson's life'                       
OL,6,FWiltshire Police said the driver of the
OL,7,FHGV, a 58-year-old man from Cardiff,   
OL,8,Fwas arrested on suspicion of causing   
OL,9,Fdeath by careless driving and has since
OL,10,Fbeen released under investigation while
OL,11,Fenquiries continue.                    
